# Translations

Frontend internationalization uses Lingui, not react-i18next.

- Source catalogs live under `packages/twenty-front/src/locales/*.po`.
- Generated catalogs live under `packages/twenty-front/src/locales/generated/`.
- Follow existing `@lingui/react` and `@lingui/core` macros and hooks.
- Keep user-facing product text translated; do not add JSON namespaces or
  `useTranslation` calls.

Follow the repository locale commands and standards documented in
`packages/twenty-front/AGENTS.md` and `AGENTS.md`.
